IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-VIA6522-TOTIENT-TX.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-VIA6522-PORTA-DIR PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-VIA6522-PORTB-DIR PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-TX-CONTEXT.
   05 D1-TX-CMD-OP         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-TX-STATUS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 D2-TOTIENT-DESCRIPTOR.
   05 D2-BASE-U            PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D2-EXP-V             PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-MOD-M             PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-TOTIENT-STAGED    PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D2-TOTIENT-COMMITTED PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D2-TOTIENT-SHADOW    PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R11.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R12.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    
    comment D1-TX-CMD-OP: 0=INIT_ZERO, 1=TRANSACT_COMMIT, 2=ROLLBACK, 3=ROLLFORWARD;
    IF D1-TX-CMD-OP == 0
        PERFORM OP-INIT-ZERO
    ELSE IF D1-TX-CMD-OP == 1
        PERFORM OP-TRANSACT-COMMIT
    ELSE IF D1-TX-CMD-OP == 2
        PERFORM OP-ROLLBACK
    ELSE IF D1-TX-CMD-OP == 3
        PERFORM OP-ROLLFORWARD
    ELSE
        MOVE 9 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
    END-IF.

    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

OP-INIT-ZERO.
    MOVE 0 TO D2-TOTIENT-STAGED.
    MOVE 0 TO D2-TOTIENT-COMMITTED.
    MOVE 0 TO D2-TOTIENT-SHADOW.
    MOVE 0 TO D1-TX-STATUS.
    IF D2-TOTIENT-COMMITTED == 0
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 1 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.
    EXIT.

OP-TRANSACT-COMMIT.
    comment Stash current state to shadow for roll-back capability;
    MOVE D2-TOTIENT-COMMITTED TO D2-TOTIENT-SHADOW.
    
    comment Compute Modpow(b=u, e=v, m=u); For u > 0 and v >= 1, u^v mod u = 0;
    IF D2-MOD-M > 0 AND D2-EXP-V >= 1
        MOVE 0 TO D2-TOTIENT-STAGED
    ELSE IF D2-EXP-V == 0 AND D2-MOD-M > 1
        MOVE 1 TO D2-TOTIENT-STAGED
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO D2-TOTIENT-STAGED
    END-IF.
    
    comment Commit transaction;
    MOVE D2-TOTIENT-STAGED TO D2-TOTIENT-COMMITTED.
    MOVE 1 TO D1-TX-STATUS.
    MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING.
    SET depth 4.
    EXIT.

OP-ROLLBACK.
    comment Roll back to shadow state;
    MOVE D2-TOTIENT-SHADOW TO D2-TOTIENT-COMMITTED.
    MOVE 2 TO D1-TX-STATUS.
    MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING.
    SET depth 4.
    EXIT.

OP-ROLLFORWARD.
    comment Roll forward to staged value;
    MOVE D2-TOTIENT-STAGED TO D2-TOTIENT-COMMITTED.
    MOVE 3 TO D1-TX-STATUS.
    MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING.
    SET depth 4.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-TOTIENT-COMMITTED - ((D2-TOTIENT-COMMITTED / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
